{"articleNo":"2290","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2290&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 후기 대학원 재입학 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.28","hit":"16857","attachments":[{"name":"재입학제출서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2290&attachNo=1510"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<font color=\"#666666\"><font size=\"4\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2009학년도 후기 대학원 재입학 공고</font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">1. 재입학 대상</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 재학중 자퇴, 미등록 미복학&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 등으로 제적된 자중 재입학을 희망하는 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2. 재입학 신청 일정</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;접수기간 : 2009. 7. 29(수) ～ 7. 31(금)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ 재입학 신청장소 : 각학과 사무실 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"3\">. 등록 및 수강신청 : 2009. 8. 18(화) ～ 8. 21(금)&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp; 3. 재입학여석</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 대학원(석사과정) 1-4학기차 00명<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 산업대학원(석사과정) 1-2학기차 00명<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 교육대학원(석사과정) 1-2학기차 00명<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp; 4. 재입학 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학 원서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 각서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;다. 지도교수 추천서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;라. 학적부 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp; 5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학이 허가된 자는 소정의 기일내에 입학금 및 기타 납입<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금의 납부등 학적제반 절차를 이행하여야 한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><font size=\"5\">금오공과대학교총장</font></span>&nbsp;<br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</font></font>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
